{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  sadd(a: i32, b: i32) = a + b\n    defined where (no C UB): t1 >= -2147483648 && t1 <= 2147483647 where t1 = i64(a) + i64(b)\n  divz(a: i32, b: i32) = a/b\n    defined where (no C UB): b != 0 && !(a == -2147483648 && b == -1)\n  shl(a: i32, n: i32) = a << n\n    defined where (no C UB): n >= 0 && n < 32 && (a >= 0 && a <= 0x7fffffff >> n)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "c_lower", "ucas": "c lower", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "c_lower", "functions": [{"function": "sadd", "value": "a + b", "where": "t1 >= -2147483648 && t1 <= 2147483647 where t1 = i64(a) + i64(b)"}, {"function": "divz", "value": "a/b", "where": "b != 0 && !(a == -2147483648 && b == -1)"}, {"function": "shl", "value": "a << n", "where": "n >= 0 && n < 32 && (a >= 0 && a <= 0x7fffffff >> n)"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "  sadd(a: i32, b: i32) = a + b\n    defined where (no C UB): t1 >= -2147483648 && t1 <= 2147483647 where t1 = i64(a) + i64(b)\n  divz(a: i32, b: i32) = a/b\n    defined where (no C UB): b != 0 && !(a == -2147483648 && b == -1)\n  shl(a: i32, n: i32) = a << n\n    defined where (no C UB): n >= 0 && n < 32 && (a >= 0 && a <= 0x7fffffff >> n)\n"}, "isError": false}}
